数据说明 / Data notice

本仓库全部数据由已知的数据生成过程（DGP）合成，不包含任何真实企业数据、
真实用户数据或商业机密。文中"电商平台""运营预算""券面额"等设定均为
模拟情景，不代表任何实际企业的经营情况。所有数值结论仅在该生成机制内成立。

All data in this repository is synthetic, produced by a known data-generating
process. It contains no real corporate data, no real user records and no trade
secrets. The e-commerce setting is a simulated scenario, not a description of
any actual company. All numerical conclusions hold only within the stated
generative mechanism.
